you to help us, then don't do it.
You need to pray about this first.&nbsp;

00:19:52.200 --> 00:19:57.120
Maybe He wants you to help someone else.
Another church, another missionary.&nbsp;

00:19:57.120 --> 00:19:59.400
I don't know.
You need to pray about this.&nbsp;

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:07.020
So, how else can you honor God with your finances?
By taking care of your own family.&nbsp;

00:20:07.800 --> 00:20:14.040
If your relatives are struggling, you need to&nbsp;
help them, especially if you know that they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:14.040 --> 00:20:19.800
are doing their best, working really hard,&nbsp;
making wise decisions and they're still&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:19.800 --> 00:20:25.560
struggling because they might be praying to God&nbsp;
to help them and God is actually blessing you.&nbsp;

00:20:25.560 --> 00:20:29.760
And it's a test for you.
They want you to help them so don't keep&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:29.760 --> 00:20:35.760
that money selfishly, just spending it on your&nbsp;
own desires while those around you are struggling.

00:20:37.200 --> 00:20:38.280
[1 Timothy 5:8]

00:20:54.360 --> 00:20:57.420
Now, if your attitude towards money&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:57.420 --> 00:21:03.840
is right, if you want to honor God financially,&nbsp;
use the money that He gives you responsibly.&nbsp;

00:21:03.840 --> 00:21:09.120
Then God will bless you with your finances&nbsp;
and you always need to remember this:

00:21:09.120 --> 00:21:10.680
[Acts 20:35]

00:21:28.680 --> 00:21:34.620
Start today and put these biblical principles of&nbsp;
how to deal with money - with your finances - put&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:34.620 --> 00:21:40.380
it into practice starting today.
And rely on Him for provision.&nbsp;

00:21:41.580 --> 00:21:48.900
If you deal with money the right way -&nbsp;
responsibly using it for God's kingdom - for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:48.900 --> 00:21:54.900
your family - using it wisely - planning for the&nbsp;
future - all these principles that we discussed in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:54.900 --> 00:21:59.580
these two videos - then God will be with you.
And He will help you.&nbsp;

00:21:59.580 --> 00:22:02.700
He will guide you and you can&nbsp;
just move forward with Him.&nbsp;

00:22:04.260 --> 00:22:10.260
Now, always remember, that life is short.
So don't waste yours.&nbsp;

00:22:10.860 --> 00:22:11.640
Bye guys.

